# Team AI Flow (router)

**Opt-in** — user gọi command hoặc nói phase/feature thì agent đọc **một** skill tương ứng.

→ Doc: `docs/operational/TEAM-AI-WORKFLOW.md`  
→ Pipeline diagram: `docs/operational/FULL-CYCLE-PIPELINE-DIAGRAM.md`  
→ Prompt templates: `docs/operational/PROMPT-TEMPLATES.md`  
→ Shared snippets: `.cursor/extracts/`  
→ Related projects: `.cursor/team-projects.example.json`

Extracts: `.cursor/extracts/legacy-config.md` (legacy paths, output language).

Một session = **một** command. State: `.harness/progress.md`.

## Design lane

| Command | Skill |
|---------|-------|
| `/spec` | `.cursor/skills/spec/SKILL.md` |
| `/legacy-spec` | `.cursor/skills/legacy-spec/SKILL.md` |
| `/bqa-grill-docs` | `.cursor/skills/bqa-grill-docs/SKILL.md` |
| `/dev-grill-docs` | `.cursor/skills/dev-grill-docs/SKILL.md` |
| `/grill-with-docs` | `.cursor/skills/grill-with-docs/SKILL.md` |
| `/update-spec` | `.cursor/skills/update-spec/SKILL.md` |
| `/update-spec-legacy` | `.cursor/skills/update-spec-legacy/SKILL.md` |
| `/prototype` | `.cursor/skills/prototype/SKILL.md` |
| `/grill-prototype` | `.cursor/skills/grill-prototype/SKILL.md` |

Typical order: `/legacy-spec` or `/spec` → `/bqa-grill-docs` → `/dev-grill-docs` → [`/grill-with-docs`] → `/prototype` → `/grill-prototype`

Gap loop: `/grill-prototype` → `/update-spec` or `/update-spec-legacy` → grill again.

`/design` is deprecated — use `/spec` or `/prototype`.

